 "profile_access": {
  "item": "29",
  "source": "code",
  "fact": "An empty profile tab of a protected account the viewer does not follow is unavailable (exit 9): the reader cannot see it, which is not the same as it being empty. A protected account the viewer follows, or a public one, with an empty tab is an explicit empty result (exit 7).",
  "cases": [
   {
